<h1><span lang="EN-US">History</span></h1>
<hr align="center" size="5" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-US">This command is accessible from</span> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Transformations &gt; History</b></span> <span lang="EN-US">or the</span> <b><i style="font-style:normal;"><span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>context menu for Current CS &gt; History</b></span></i></b><span lang="EN-US">.</span></p>
<p class="Description"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-US">Description</span>: The command</b> <b style="font-weight:normal;"><span class="Command">History</span></b> <span lang="EN-US">is used to manage the applied transformations to the current CS.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-US"><img src="../transformation_menu/Transformations_files/image004.gif" width="479px" height="367px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></span></p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><b style="font-weight:bold;">History description list</b>:</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">List of all applied transformations for the current document and for the current KUBE session. If you open new KUBE session and reload the same document the history will be cleaned up. The processes in the list appear by the order of their applying.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-US">Transformation Details section</span>:</b></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-US">Displays information about the parameters of the currently selected transformation in the list of history description.</span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-US">Copy as Transformation section</span>:</b></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-US">Name</span> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:normal;">edit box</span></b><span lang="EN-US">: Type a name for the new transformation or leave the default one. The default name is "Transformation N", where N is the number of the subsequent newly created transformation. When a transformation is created the number N in the name will automatically increase.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><b style="font-weight:normal;"><span class="Button" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Create</b></span> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:normal;">button</span></b><span lang="EN-US">: creates a new transformation in the entity tree from the selected transformation.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span class="Button">Close</span> <span lang="EN-US">button:</span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-US">Exits the history dialog.</span></p>
